. Wilson\" src=\"ISic000513_detail_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000513_detail.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo R.J.A. Wilson\" src=\"ISic000513_detail-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>text from photograph</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>To Caius Bultius Geminius Titianus, proconsul of the province of Sicily, consularis and vir clarissimus, on account of his distinguished goodwill towards the ordo and his fatherland. The twelve tribes (set this up) to their deserving patron.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The son of this individual is honoured in a second inscription from Mazara, <a href=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000486\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000486</a></p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 6770a <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000352\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000352</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 244 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] 136 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Muratori 1740 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/Muratori1740Vol2\" target=\"_blank\">683 no.2</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001395\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001395</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7233</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Sartori 1957 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001604\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001604</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1980 422 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001836\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001836</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 53 and tav.21 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>A in lines 2, 5 and 7 has broken bar</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
